<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>보석반 곱셈 탐험 ②</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&family=Gaegu:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#FFF8EF;
    --ink:#2D2A3E;
    --ink-soft:#635F78;
    --purple:#8B6FD9;
    --purple-deep:#6B4FBF;
    --purple-light:#E4DBFB;
    --mint:#2FBFA8;
    --mint-deep:#1F9A87;
    --mint-light:#D6F5EF;
    --coral:#FF6F91;
    --coral-deep:#E24F72;
    --coral-light:#FFE1E9;
    --yellow:#FFC857;
    --yellow-deep:#E8A93A;
    --card:#FFFFFF;
    --radius:22px;
    --shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(107,79,191,0.12);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 8% 10%, rgba(255,200,87,0.18), transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 85%, rgba(47,191,168,0.16), transparent 42%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 8%, rgba(255,111,145,0.14), transparent 38%),
      var(--bg);
    font-family:'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    min-height:100vh;
    padding:20px 14px 60px;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;}
  h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Jua', sans-serif; font-weight:400; margin:0;}
  .brand{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .brand svg{width:38px;height:38px;}
  .brand h1{font-size:26px; color:var(--purple-deep); letter-spacing:0.5px;}
  .lesson-badge{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--yellow);
    color:#8A5E00; font-size:15px; vertical-align:middle; box-shadow:0 3px 0 var(--yellow-deep);
  }
  .brand .sub{font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:2px;}
  .brand-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}

  .gem-progress{display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:16px; margin:0 0 22px;}
  .gem-step{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
  .gem-step svg{width:44px;height:44px;transition:transform .25s ease;}
  .gem-step.active svg{transform:scale(1.12);}
  .gem-step span{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:500;}
  .gem-step.active span{color:var(--purple-deep);font-weight:700;}

  .card{
    background:var(--card);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    padding:26px 22px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    border:2px solid rgba(139,111,217,0.08);
    animation:pop .35s ease;
  }
  @keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

  .eyebrow{font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--mint-deep); letter-spacing:1px; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .step-title{font-size:22px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:6px;}
  .desc{font-size:14.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:18px;}

  label{display:block; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:var(--purple-deep); margin:14px 0 6px;}
  input[type=number], input[type=text]{
    width:100%; padding:13px 14px; font-size:17px; border-radius:14px;
    border:2px solid var(--purple-light); background:#FBFAFF; color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; outline:none; transition:border .15s;
  }
  input:focus{border-color:var(--purple);}
  .row2{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px;}
  .random-slots{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; margin:18px 0 6px;
  }
  .slot-box{
    font-family:'Jua',sans-serif; font-size:30px; color:var(--purple-deep);
    background:var(--purple-light); border:3px solid var(--purple);
    border-radius:16px; padding:14px 20px; min-width:110px; text-align:center;
    letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  .slot-box.slot-small{min-width:70px;}
  .slot-x{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif; font-size:24px; color:var(--coral-deep);}
  .slot-box.spinning{color:var(--mint-deep); background:var(--mint-light); border-color:var(--mint);}
  .slot-box.landed{animation:slotPop .45s ease;}
  @keyframes slotPop{
    0%{transform:scale(0.7); background:var(--yellow); border-color:var(--yellow-deep);}
    55%{transform:scale(1.18); background:var(--yellow); border-color:var(--yellow-deep);}
    100%{transform:scale(1);}
  }
  .row3{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:12px;}

  .btn{
    appearance:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;
    font-size:16px; padding:13px 22px; border-radius:16px; color:#fff;
    background:var(--purple); box-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--purple-deep);
    transition:transform .08s ease, box-shadow .08s ease;
  }
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(4px); box-shadow:0 2px 0 var(--purple-deep);}
  .btn:disabled{background:#D7D3E8; box-shadow:0 6px 0 #BEB8D6; cursor:not-allowed; color:#fff;}
  .btn.secondary{background:var(--mint); box-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--mint-deep);}
  .btn.secondary:disabled{background:#D7D3E8; box-shadow:0 6px 0 #BEB8D6;}
  .btn.coral{background:var(--coral); box-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--coral-deep);}
  .btn.small{font-size:13px; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15);}
  .btn.ghost{background:transparent; color:var(--purple-deep); box-shadow:none; text-decoration:underline; font-family:'Noto Sans KR'; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; padding:6px;}
  .btn-row{display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:20px; justify-content:flex-end; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .problem-pill{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:14px;
    background:var(--purple-light); border-radius:18px; padding:16px;
    font-family:'Jua',sans-serif; font-size:30px; color:var(--purple-deep);
    margin-bottom:16px; letter-spacing:2px;
  }
  .problem-pill .x{font-size:22px; color:var(--coral-deep);}

  /* base-ten block visuals (shared by palette + dropzone + teacher view) */
  .block-hundred{
    width:44px;height:44px;background:var(--purple-light); border:2px solid var(--purple);
    border-radius:5px;
    background-image:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(107,79,191,0.55) 1px, transparent 1px),
                      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(107,79,191,0.55) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:4.4px 4.4px;
  }
  .block-ten{
    width:9px;height:44px;background:var(--mint); border:2px solid var(--mint-deep); border-radius:3px;
    background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:100% 4.4px;
  }
  .block-one{
    width:14px;height:14px;background:var(--coral); border:2px solid var(--coral-deep); border-radius:3px;
  }
  .block-thousand{
    width:44px;height:44px;background:var(--purple-deep); color:#fff; font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;
    font-size:11px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    border-radius:6px; border:2px solid #4a3585;
  }
  .selectable{cursor:pointer; transition:transform .1s;}
  .selectable:hover{transform:scale(1.08);}
  .selected{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--yellow-deep), 0 0 10px rgba(232,169,58,0.7);}
  .regrouped-new{animation:popReveal .4s ease; box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--yellow-deep);}
  .regroup-tip{
    font-size:12.5px; color:var(--purple-deep); background:var(--purple-light);
    border-radius:12px; padding:10px 14px; margin-bottom:12px; line-height:1.6; font-weight:500;
  }
  .merged-box{
    border-color:var(--purple); background:var(--purple-light);
    animation:popReveal .4s ease;
  }
  @keyframes popReveal{
    0%{transform:scale(0.85); opacity:0.4;}
    60%{transform:scale(1.05);}
    100%{transform:scale(1); opacity:1;}
  }
  .regroup-sel-count{
    font-size:11.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink-soft); text-align:center; margin:6px 0 10px;
  }

  /* palette (draggable source) */
  .palette{display:flex; gap:22px; justify-content:center; align-items:flex-end; margin:14px 0; padding:16px 10px; background:var(--mint-light); border-radius:18px; border:2px dashed var(--mint);}
  .palette-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:grab; user-select:none; touch-action:none;}
  .palette-item:active{cursor:grabbing;}
  .palette-item span{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--mint-deep); text-align:center;}
  .drag-ghost{position:fixed; pointer-events:none; z-index:999; opacity:0.85; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);}

  /* dropzone (target) */
  .dropzone{min-height:110px; border:3px dashed var(--purple); border-radius:16px; background:#FBFAFF; padding:12px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-content:flex-start; gap:6px; position:relative;}
  .dropzone.empty::after{content:'👆 위 모형을 여기로 끌어다 놓아요'; color:#c3bfe0; font-size:12.5px; position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center; pointer-events:none; text-align:center; padding:0 20px;}
  .dz-block{cursor:pointer;}
  .counts-line{font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:var(--purple-deep); margin:10px 0 4px; text-align:center;}
  .locked-groups{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .group-box{border:2px solid var(--mint); border-radius:14px; padding:10px 12px; background:var(--mint-light); min-width:fit-content;}
  .group-box .g-label{font-size:11px; font-weight:700; color:var(--mint-deep); margin-bottom:6px;}
  .blk-row{display:flex; gap:4px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:4px; min-height:14px;}
  .hint-msg{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--coral-deep); font-weight:700; margin-top:8px; min-height:16px; text-align:center;}
  .dz-toolbar{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-top:10px; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .final-answer-box{
    background:var(--purple-light); border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:16px 0; text-align:center;
    border:2px solid var(--purple);
  }
  .final-answer-box label{color:var(--purple-deep); font-size:14.5px; margin:0 0 10px;}
  .final-answer-row{display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; align-items:center;}
  .final-answer-row input{width:140px; text-align:center; font-family:'Jua',sans-serif; font-size:20px;}
  .final-feedback{font-size:13px; font-weight:700; margin-top:10px; min-height:16px;}
  .final-feedback.ok{color:var(--mint-deep);}
  .final-feedback.bad{color:var(--coral-deep);}

  .tally-box{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFE9BC,#FFDA8A);
    border-radius:16px; padding:14px 16px; margin:14px 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.9;
    color:#6B4E12; border:2px solid var(--yellow-deep);
  }
  .tally-box b{color:#8A5E00;}
  .tally-line{padding:2px 0;}
  .tally-final{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif; font-size:20px; margin-top:8px; color:var(--coral-deep);}

  textarea{
    width:100%; min-height:80px; border-radius:14px; border:2px solid var(--purple-light);
    background:#FBFAFF; padding:12px 14px; font-family:'Noto Sans KR'; font-size:14.5px;
    resize:vertical; outline:none;
  }
  textarea:focus{border-color:var(--purple);}

  /* drawing pad (step 3) */
  .draw-wrap{position:relative; width:fit-content; margin:0 auto; max-width:100%;}
  .guide-layer{position:relative; width:264px; height:230px; max-width:100%; background:#FBFAFF; border-radius:14px; border:2px solid var(--purple-light); overflow:hidden;}
  .guide-num{position:absolute; font-family:'Jua',sans-serif; font-size:24px; color:var(--purple-deep); width:40px; text-align:center;}
  .guide-op{position:absolute; font-family:'Jua',sans-serif; font-size:20px; color:var(--coral-deep);}
  .guide-line{position:absolute; left:6px; right:6px; border-top:3px solid var(--ink);}
  .draw-canvas{position:absolute; top:0; left:0; touch-action:none; cursor:crosshair;}
  .pen-toolbar{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-top:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .swatch{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%; border:3px solid transparent; cursor:pointer; padding:0;}
  .swatch.active{border-color:var(--ink);}
  .tool-btn{padding:8px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:2px solid var(--purple-light); background:#fff; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--purple-deep); cursor:pointer;}
  .tool-btn.active{background:var(--purple); color:#fff; border-color:var(--purple);}

  .login-foot{text-align:center; margin-top:6px;}
  .err{color:var(--coral-deep); font-size:12.5px; margin-top:6px; min-height:16px; font-weight:700;}

  /* teacher view */
  .t-record{border:2px solid var(--purple-light); border-radius:16px; padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:12px; background:#FBFAFF;}
  .t-record h4{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:var(--purple-deep); margin-bottom:6px;}
  .t-record .meta{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:8px;}
  .t-record .field{font-size:13.5px; margin:4px 0; line-height:1.5;}
  .t-record .field b{color:var(--mint-deep);}
  .t-toolbar{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px;}
  .t-count{font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  .center{text-align:center;}
  .hidden{display:none !important;}
  .loading-dot{display:inline-block; animation:blink 1s infinite;}
  @keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0.2;}}

  @media(max-width:420px){
    .problem-pill{font-size:24px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="brand">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><polygon points="50,4 90,35 74,96 26,96 10,35" fill="#8B6FD9" opacity="0.9"/><polygon points="50,4 90,35 50,50" fill="#C9B8F5"/><polygon points="10,35 50,50 26,96" fill="#6B4FBF"/><polygon points="90,35 74,96 50,50" fill="#9B7FE0"/></svg>
    <div class="brand-col">
      <h1>보석반 곱셈 탐험 <span class="lesson-badge">②</span></h1>
      <div class="sub">세 자리 수 × 한 자리 수 이야기 · 받아올림이 한 번 있는 경우</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LOGIN -->
  <div id="screen-login" class="card">
    <div class="eyebrow">STEP 0 · 입장하기</div>
    <div class="step-title">누구인가요?</div>
    <div class="desc">학년, 반, 번호를 입력하고 곱셈 탐험을 시작해요.</div>
    <div class="row3">
      <div>
        <label for="in-grade">학년</label>
        <input type="number" id="in-grade" min="1" max="6" placeholder="예: 4">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="in-class">반</label>
        <input type="number" id="in-class" min="1" max="20" placeholder="예: 3">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="in-number">번호</label>
        <input type="number" id="in-number" min="1" max="40" placeholder="예: 12">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="err" id="login-err"></div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn" id="btn-login">탐험 시작하기 🚪</button>
    </div>
    <div class="login-foot">
      <button class="btn ghost" id="btn-teacher-open">🍎 선생님이신가요? 결과 보기</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN APP (after login) -->
  <div id="app-area" class="hidden">
    <div class="gem-progress" id="gem-progress"></div>

    <!-- STEP 1 -->
    <div id="screen-1" class="card hidden">
      <div class="eyebrow">STEP 1 · 문제 만들기</div>
      <div class="step-title">받아올림이 한 번 있는 문제 뽑기</div>
      <div class="desc">이번 미션은 특별해요! 버튼을 누르면 <b>받아올림이 딱 한 번만</b> 생기는 (세 자리 수)×(한 자리 수) 문제가 랜덤으로 나와요.</div>
      <div class="random-slots">
        <div class="slot-box" id="slot-big">( &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; )</div>
        <div class="slot-x">×</div>
        <div class="slot-box slot-small" id="slot-small">( &nbsp; )</div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center;">
        <button class="btn coral" id="btn-draw">문제 뽑기 🎲</button>
      </div>
      <div class="err" id="step1-err"></div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <button class="btn secondary" id="btn-step1-next" disabled>수모형으로 나타내러 가기 →</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STEP 2 -->
    <div id="screen-2" class="card hidden">
      <div class="eyebrow">STEP 2 · 수모형으로 나타내기</div>
      <div class="step-title">수모형을 끌어와 곱셈 표현하기</div>
      <div class="problem-pill" id="s2-problem"></div>
      <div class="desc" id="s2-desc"></div>

      <div class="palette" id="palette">
        <div class="palette-item" data-type="h"><div class="block-hundred"></div><span>백 모형<br>(100)</span></div>
        <div class="palette-item" data-type="t"><div class="block-ten"></div><span>십 모형<br>(10)</span></div>
        <div class="palette-item" data-type="o"><div class="block-one"></div><span>일 모형<br>(1)</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="locked-groups" id="locked-groups"></div>

      <div id="active-group-area">
        <div class="counts-line" id="counts-line">지금 담은 모형: 백 0개 · 십 0개 · 일 0개</div>
        <div class="dropzone empty" id="dropzone"></div>
        <div class="hint-msg" id="hint-msg"></div>
        <div class="dz-toolbar">
          <span style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:700;" id="group-counter"></span>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
            <button class="btn ghost" id="btn-clear-active">초기화</button>
            <button class="btn secondary small" id="btn-check-group">묶음 확인하기 ✔</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="regroup-area" class="hidden">
        <div class="regroup-tip">🎉 묶음을 모두 합쳤어요! 낱개(일) 모형을 10개 눌러 모으면 십 모형 1개로, 십 모형을 10개 모으면 백 모형 1개로 바뀌어요. 모형을 눌러서 올림을 해보세요.</div>
        <div class="regroup-sel-count" id="regroup-sel-count"></div>
        <div class="hint-msg" id="regroup-msg"></div>
      </div>

      <div id="final-answer-area" class="hidden">
        <div class="final-answer-box">
          <label for="in-final-answer">👀 수모형을 확인해서 몇인지 쓰시오.</label>
          <div class="final-answer-row">
            <input type="number" id="in-final-answer" placeholder="?">
            <button class="btn secondary small" id="btn-check-final">확인하기 ✔</button>
          </div>
          <div class="final-feedback" id="final-feedback"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="tally-area"></div>

      <div class="btn-row">
        <button class="btn" id="btn-step2-next" disabled>세로셈으로 나타내러 가기 →</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STEP 3 -->
    <div id="screen-3" class="card hidden">
      <div class="eyebrow">STEP 3 · 세로셈으로 나타내기</div>
      <div class="step-title">세로셈으로 직접 써보기</div>
      <div class="desc">아래 그림판에 펜으로 직접 세로셈을 써서 계산해 보세요. 받아올림한 숫자도 적어보아요.</div>

      <div class="draw-wrap"><div class="guide-layer" id="guide-layer"></div></div>

      <div class="pen-toolbar" id="pen-toolbar"></div>

      <div class="btn-row">
        <button class="btn" id="btn-submit" disabled>제출하기 🎉</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DONE -->
    <div id="screen-done" class="card hidden center">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="72" height="72"><polygon points="50,4 90,35 74,96 26,96 10,35" fill="#FFC857"/><polygon points="50,4 90,35 50,50" fill="#FFE1A6"/><polygon points="10,35 50,50 26,96" fill="#E8A93A"/><polygon points="90,35 74,96 50,50" fill="#FFD57A"/></svg>
      <div class="step-title" style="margin-top:8px;">제출 완료! 잘했어요 👏</div>
      <div class="desc" id="done-msg"></div>
      <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center;">
